# Production build env — RealSight (propsight-prod Supabase project).
# These are PUBLIC values: the Supabase URL + anon key are RLS-protected
# and already shipped in the live web bundle at realsight.app. Committed
# so `npm run build` (web AND Capacitor iOS/Android) always has the
# database connection — without this the native app boots to a blank
# screen because the Supabase client can't initialise.
